#. Description of the plugin
#: lingua-forge.php
msgid ""
"Multilingual routing, SEO meta tags, and AI content tools for WordPress. "
"Combines language detection, URL routing, hreflang, meta descriptions, and "
"AI-powered excerpt, meta, and translation features."
msgstr ""
"Usanifu wa lugha nyingi, alama za meta za SEO, na zana za maudhui za AI kwa "
"WordPress. Inachanganya utambuzi wa lugha, usafirishaji wa URL, hreflang, "
"maelezo ya meta, na sifa za kukata, meta, na tafsiri zinazotumiwa na AI."

