#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:107
msgid ""
"Translation Memory caches AI results by content hash, language pair, "
"provider, and model. Editing a post invalidates the cache entry so the next "
"translate call gets a fresh result."
msgstr ""
"Kumbukumbu za Tafsiri hufanya kazi kwa kuhifadhi matokeo ya AI kwa hash ya "
"maudhui, jozi ya lugha, mtoa huduma, na mfano. Kuhariri chapisho "
"kunavunjilia mbali kumbukumbu ili simu inayofuata ya tafsiri ipate matokeo "
"mapya."

